\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O thou to whose all-searching sight
\par The darkness shineth as the light,
\par Search, prove my heart; it pants for Thee;
\par O burst these bonds, and set it free!\tab 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Wash out its stains, refine its dross,
\par Nail my affections to the Cross;
\par Hallow each thought; let all within
\par Be clean, as thou, my Lord, art clean.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When rising floods my soul o'erflow,
\par When sinks my heart in waves of woe,
\par Jesu, Thy timely aid impart
\par And raise my head, and chear my heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Saviour, where'ver Thy steps I see,
\par Dauntless, untired, I follow Thee;
\par O let Thy hand support me still,
\par And lead me to Thy holy hill!
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

